  number    =  12,
  pages     = "493--501",
  abstract  = "A new class of visuomotor neuron has been recently discovered in
               the monkey's premotor cortex: mirror neurons. These neurons
               respond both when a particular action is performed by the
               recorded monkey and when the same action, performed by another
               individual, is observed. Mirror neurons appear to form a cortical
