  number    =  1,
  pages     = "34--44",
  abstract  = "The Community Assessment of Psychic Experiences (CAPE) has been
               used extensively as a measurement for psychosis proneness in
               clinical and research settings. However, no prior review and
               meta-analysis have comprehensively examined psychometric
               properties (reliability and validity) of CAPE scores across
