  number    =  1,
  pages     =  1627,
  abstract  = "Humans are voracious imaginers, with internal simulations
               supporting memory, planning and decision-making. Because the
               neural mechanisms supporting imagery overlap with those
               supporting perception, a foundational question is how reality and
               imagination are kept apart. One possibility is that the intention
