  volume    =  125,
  number    = "Pt 8",
  pages     = "1839--1849",
  abstract  = "Ten able adults with autism or Asperger syndrome and 10 normal
               volunteers were PET scanned while watching animated sequences.
               The animations depicted two triangles moving about on a screen in
               three different conditions: moving randomly, moving in a
               goal-directed fashion (chasing, fighting), and moving
