  author        = "Finn, Chelsea and Abbeel, Pieter and Levine, Sergey",
  journal       = "arXiv [cs.LG]",
  abstract      = "We propose an algorithm for meta-learning that is
                   model-agnostic, in the sense that it is compatible with any
                   model trained with gradient descent and applicable to a
                   variety of different learning problems, including
                   classification, regression, and reinforcement learning. The
                   goal of meta-learning is to train a model on a variety of
