  author    = "Schafer, Matthew and Schiller, Daniela",
  journal   = "Neuron",
  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    =  100,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "476--489",
  abstract  = "Cognitive maps are encoded in the hippocampal formation and
               related regions and range from the spatial to the purely
               conceptual. Neural mechanisms that encode information into
               relational structures, up to an arbitrary level of abstraction,
               may explain such a broad range of representation. Research now
