  volume    =  33,
  pages     = "2661--2673",
  abstract  = "Developing an empathetic dialogue system has been a challenge for
               years. Although most system responses are grammatically correct
               and convey emotions to some extent, their quality still falls
               short of human standards. In this study, an integrated system
               called the Plug-and-Play Rational Speech Act (PPRSA) was
