               of the cultural language setting at hand, the theory-of-mind
               capacities of the speaker, and the affordances of the specific
               context in which the speech event takes place. It is demonstrated
               that the framework has the potential to reconcile findings in the
               literature that previously seemed irreconcilable. We show that
