                  simulating behavior from neural interactions",
  author       = "Haspel, Gal and Baker, Ben and Beets, Isabel and Boyden,
                  Edward S and Brown, Jeffrey and Church, George and Cohen,
                  Netta and Colon-Ramos, Daniel and Dyer, Eva and Fang-Yen,
