  number    =  1689332,
  pages     =  1689332,
  abstract  = "C. elegans is a model organism in many biological domains, such
               as genetics, neurophysiology, and behavioral ecology. Despite our
               relatively deep knowledge of the neuronal, genetic and molecular
               mechanisms underlying C. elegans communication, we still lack a
               comprehensive understanding of emergent group-level dynamics. We
