  volume    =  16,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "e0243121",
  abstract  = "Autism spectrum disorder (ASD) is a neurodevelopmental disorder
               characterised by a triad of behavioural impairments and includes
               disruption in social behaviour. ASD has a clear genetic
               underpinning and hundreds of genes are implicated in its
               aetiology. However, how single penetrant genes disrupt activity
