                   on a task inspired by prior inverse planning models and
                   improving performance relative to models that utilize LLMs
                   alone or with chain-of-thought prompting, even with smaller
                   LLMs that typically perform poorly on ToM tasks. We also
                   exhibit the model's potential to predict mental states on
