  volume    =  4,
  number    =  11,
  pages     = "e1000211",
  abstract  = "This paper describes a general model that subsumes many
               parametric models for continuous data. The model comprises hidden
               layers of state-space or dynamic causal models, arranged so that
               the output of one provides input to another. The ensuing
               hierarchy furnishes a model for many types of data, of arbitrary
