  number    =  45,
  pages     = "9689--9699",
  abstract  = "Understanding movies and stories requires maintaining a
               high-level situation model that abstracts away from perceptual
               details to describe the location, characters, actions, and causal
               relationships of the currently unfolding event. These models are
               built not only from information present in the current narrative,
